# OpenAI driver — the LLM the agent uses to READ / EXTRACT / EXPLAIN.
# Per Methodology 1 §3/§6: the LLM finds evidence and codes qualitative call/slides
# signals; it NEVER sets the numeric forecast. The numeric pipeline runs fine without it.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key. .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
